{
    "talkId": "6985602",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 53,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Ineffa": 31,
        "Jahoda": 3,
        "Paimon": 7,
        "Player": 12
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698560201",
            "speaker": "Ineffa",
            "text": "..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698560202",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Ineffa?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698560203",
            "speaker": "Ineffa",
            "text": "...",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698560204",
                    "text": "Is she asleep?",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698560206",
                            "speaker": "Jahoda",
                            "text": "Zzz... Zzz..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560207",
                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                            "text": "Why is Jahoda here? And she's... asleep?"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560208",
                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                            "text": "Hey, what's going on here? Paimon feels like it's a bad idea for us to leave... Maybe we should ask Aino for help."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560209",
                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                            "text": "Keyword detected. Meditative state suspended."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560210",
                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                            "text": "Whoa! You gave Paimon a fright!"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560211",
                            "speaker": "Player",
                            "text": "Do robots need to meditate?"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560212",
                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                            "text": "No. However, it was Jahoda's request. She asked me for a detailed analysis of the steps required to meditate and to mentor her as she practiced relieving her stress."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698560213",
                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                            "text": "Jahoda's so stressed that she's gotta meditate to cope with it all?",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698560214",
                                    "text": "Is there something troubling her?",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560216",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "I do not know. However, Jahoda said she has been suffering from insomnia for a while, and was willing to try any solution she could."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560217",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "First, I let her stand in my kitchen, close her eyes, and focus on the fragrance of krumkakes."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560218",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "By stimulating her olfactory module, I believed there would be a decrease in activity in her cognitive module..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560219",
                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                            "text": "Did it work?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560220",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "It successfully stimulated her appetite. She consumed the finished krumkakes with incredible efficiency."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560221",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "Unfortunately, she consumed too many and proved unable to sleep that night."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560222",
                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                            "text": "That's normal... We're not robots like you, after all. The more we smell food, the more we wanna eat it!"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560223",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "That is indeed true. Afterwards, I tried to have her perform intense mental or physical exercises before bed. For example, cutting lumber, jogging, doing pushups, boxing, and so on."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560224",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "Her body should have been able to enter sleep mode more easily following such sizable expenditures of energy."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560225",
                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                            "text": "But... I'm guessing it didn't work."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560226",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "It did not. She finished half her exercises, realized she had an unfinished commission, and so rushed off to complete it."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560227",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "After she returned, she crouched down in a corner, hugging her knees, and said:"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560228",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "\"Ahh... I was so tired from all that training, my legs gave out while guiding my clients through the ruins — I basically crawled the whole way... If Boss Nef finds out, I'm dead meat...\""
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560229",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "Following this, she was once more unable to sleep."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560230",
                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                            "text": "In the end, we decided to give meditation another try."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560231",
                                            "speaker": "Jahoda",
                                            "text": "Boss Nef... N—No... Wasn't me. Didn't steal your tea... *snore*"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698560232",
                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                            "text": "Seems like the meditation was pretty effective. Jahoda's fast asleep!",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698560233",
                                                    "text": "She's starting to talk in her sleep...",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560235",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "I do not think Jahoda's sleep is related to her meditation."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560236",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "First of all, the meditation steps I analyzed are not suitable for her."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560237",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "The goal of meditation is to enter a deep state of tranquility, which can be used to enhance self-awareness."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560238",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "For an ordinary person, this deep state is close to \"dozing.\""
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560239",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "For me, this would be closer to a \"low power standby mode,\" where one cuts power to certain components."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560240",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "That said, were we to shut down some of Jahoda's components, I believe it would pose a threat to her personal safety."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560241",
                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                            "text": "So meditation wasn't supposed to work, but Jahoda fell asleep anyway... Could she have been so tired that she just passed out?"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560242",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "In truth, I do not understand either. All I can do is tell you what happened before."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560243",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "When Jahoda lay down and tried to fall asleep through meditation, she suddenly said to me:"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560244",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "\"Don't run off too far, or I might get ambushed in my sleep... and then I'd be dead meat...\""
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560245",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "I answered her, \"Very well. I will remain here by your side.\""
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560246",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "After that, like I do with Aino every night, I held Jahoda's hand as she slept."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560247",
                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                            "text": "After a while, she did, indeed, fall asleep."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698560248",
                                                            "speaker": "Jahoda",
                                                            "text": "Dummy... robot... This is somethin' I did... myself... *snore*",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698560249",
                                                                    "text": "In any case, it's good that she is getting the rest she needs.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698560251",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                                            "text": "Yes. And if either of you need help sleeping, please consult me at any time. However, do note that I can only hold two hands at once."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698560252",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                                            "text": "Oh, by the way, I have leftover \"Krumkake Bolts\" from the batch I made earlier. I gave one to Jahoda. You can have the other."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698560253",
                                                                            "speaker": "Ineffa",
                                                                            "text": "Goodbye. I hope you have sweet dreams tonight."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698560250",
                                                                    "text": "Maybe we should let her sleep in peace."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698560234",
                                                    "text": "So it was because of Nefer all along..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698560215",
                                    "text": "Did Nefer assign her another job?"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "698560205",
                    "text": "Has her battery gone flat?"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}